*-----------------------------------------------------------
* Pin Definition File for QSymGen3
*
* Implements: Microchip PIC18F45K50/PIC18LF45K50 (40-pin PDIP/UQFN)
* Author:     Robert Dunn
* Source:     DS30000684B, TABLE 1-3
* Revised:    2026.07.14
*-----------------------------------------------------------
*
* Pin names/descriptions verified IDENTICAL across PDIP, TQFP,
* and UQFN packages -- TABLE 1-3 is a single shared table with
* one Pin Name/Type/Buffer Type/Description column set; only
* physical Pin Number differs per package (PDIP/TQFP/UQFN
* columns). This file targets the 40-pin PDIP/UQFN pinout
* (excludes ICCK/ICPGC, ICDT/ICPGD, ICRST/ICVPP, NC -- 44-pin
* TQFP only).
*
* No directional-arrow annotations present in datasheet Pin
* Diagram figures (Figure 3/4) for this family -- cross-check
* step not applicable.
*
* OPEN ITEM: VUSB3V3 is an internal 3.3V regulator OUTPUT
* (positive supply for USB transceiver), not a simple supply
* input. Classified I here per the existing "extra V/G pins
* -> I record" convention, but that convention is untested /
* may not be correct for a regulator output -- needs a decision.
*
* D Microchip PIC18F45K50/PIC18LF45K50
D Microchip PIC18F45K50/PIC18LF45K50 40-Pin PDIP/UQFN
P PIC18F45K50 PIC18LF45K50
R 1
*
* VDD: 2 physical pins on PDIP (11, 32) -- duplicate, same net
V VDD
B D+ IOCC5
B D- IOCC4
B RA0 C12IN0-/AN0
B RA1 C12IN1-/AN1
B RA2 C2IN+/AN2/DACOUT/VREF-
B RA3 C1IN+/AN3/VREF+
B RA4 C1OUT/SRQ/T0CKI
B RA5 C2OUT/SRNQ/SS/HLVDIN/AN4
B RA6 CLKO/OSC2
B RA7 CLKI/OSC1
B RB0 INT0/FLT0/SDI/SDA/SRI/AN12
B RB1 INT1/P1C/SCK/SCL/C12IN3-/AN10
B RB2 P1B/INT2/CTED1/AN8
B RB3 CTED2/SDO/CCP2/C12IN2-/AN9
B RB4 IOCB4/P1D/AN11
B RB5 IOCB5/T3CKI/T1G/AN13
B RB6 IOCB6/PGC
X
K SIMCLK [Not A Device Pin]
B RB7 IOCB7/PGD
B RC0 IOCC0/T3CKI/T3G/T1CKI/SOSCO
B RC1 IOCC1/CCP2/SOSCI
B RC2 CTPLS/P1A/CCP1/IOCC2/AN14
B RC6 IOCC6/TX/CK/AN18
B RC7 RX/DT/SDO/IOCC7/AN19
B RD0 AN20
B RD1 AN21
B RD2 AN22
B RD3 AN23
B RD4 AN24
B RD5 P1B/AN25
B RD6 P1C/AN26
B RD7 P1D/AN27
B RE0 AN5
B RE1 AN6
B RE2 AN7
I RE3 VPP/MCLR
* I VUSB3V3 [OPEN ITEM: regulator output, see header]
I VUSB3V3 [CHECK THIS!]
* VSS: 2 physical pins on PDIP (12, 31) -- duplicate, same net
G VSS
